  lines:
  - npcText: Wow, you made it until here, quite impressive... Unfortunately, this
      is the end of the Demo. Thank you for stepping into the Infernet, I'm sure
      you understand the potential of the Pentacle Protocol software. Who knows,
      maybe we ill eachother again...
    answers:
    - text: Wait no...
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Finally !
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Can I contact the dev team ?
      nextLineIndex: 1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - npcText: Yes you can, They have a page on Itch.io called Pentacle Protocol, it
      will be esay to contact them.
    answers:
    - text: Thank you.
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
